   "ding": true,
   "ding_at": 0.1
  },
  {
   "bg": "deck",
   "time": "sunset",
   "text": "In the 1800s, a sailor named Tom was lost at sea.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.3,
     "expr": "worried",
     "pose": "idle",
     "talk": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "deck",
   "time": "sunset",
   "far_lh": true,
   "text": "Then he spotted a lighthouse on the coast.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.3,
     "expr": "happy",
     "pose": "point",
     "look": 1,
     "talk": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "deck",
   "time": "sunset",
   "far_lh": true,
   "text": "Great! But which one?",
   "bubble": "?",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.3,
     "expr": "thinking",
     "pose": "shrug",
     "talk": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "coast_same",
   "time": "day",
   "text": "There were dozens along the coast, and from far away, they all looked exactly the same.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.18,
     "y": 0.92,
     "s": 0.9,
     "expr": "worried",
     "pose": "idle",
     "look": 1
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "rocks",
   "time": "sunset",
   "text": "Pick the wrong one, and you could sail straight into the rocks.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.86,
     "s": 1.0,
     "expr": "shocked",
     "pose": "panic"
    }
   ],
   "shake": true
  },
  {
   "bg": "workshop",
   "text": "So builders came up with a clever trick.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.68,
     "y": 0.88,
     "outfit": "engineer",
     "expr": "happy",
     "pose": "point",
     "talk": true,
     "look": -1
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "coast_patterns",
   "time": "day",
   "text": "They painted every lighthouse differently. Stripes, spirals, checkers, and bands.",
   "chars": []
  },
  {
   "bg": "coast_patterns",
   "time": "dawn",
   "text": "These patterns are called daymarks.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.8,
     "y": 0.92,
     "s": 0.85,
     "outfit": "engineer",
     "expr": "happy",
     "pose": "wave"
    }
   ],
   "ding": true
  },
  {
   "bg": "chart",
   "text": "Now Tom just checked his chart. Black and white spiral? That's Cape Hatteras!",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.8,
     "y": 0.97,
     "s": 0.9,
     "expr": "happy",
     "pose": "point",
     "look": -1,
     "talk": true
    }
   ],
   "ding": true,
   "ding_at": 2.6
  },
  {
   "bg": "night_row",
   "time": "night",
   "text": "But at night, you can't see paint.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.2,
     "y": 0.93,
     "s": 0.85,
     "expr": "worried",
     "pose": "shrug"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "night_row",
   "time": "night",
   "text": "So every light got its own rhythm. One flashes every few seconds. Another blinks twice, then pauses.",
   "chars": []
  },
  {
   "bg": "deck",
   "time": "night",
   "far_lh": true,
   "text": "Sailors could read the coast like a book.",
   "chars": [
    {
     "x": 0.3,
     "expr": "happy",
     "pose": "wave",
     "talk": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "spiral_hero",
   "time": "day",
   "text": "So that striped lighthouse isn't decoration. It's a name tag for ships. Follow Bolt for a new 'why' every day!",
